        <fr:title text="Why a new DSL?">Why a new DSL?</fr:title>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>Thousands of custom GPU kernels are in use at large
  companies. These are hard to port to new hardware, accumulate tech
  debt, and aren't ameable to heterogenous hardware.</html:p>
        <html:p>There are things that are manual in Triton that could in principle
  be automated.</html:p>
        <html:p>When using CUDA, one needs to write assembly by hand.</html:p>
      </fr:mainmatter>
